      <activity id="05404054-7a47-524b-96f2-e17adf15d34e" activityNameId="b9368d7d-a95b-5a88-905c-fed818b3564d" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Capacitor, unspecified, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Capacitor, unspecified, at plant
This module represents an unweighted average of all specific capacitor datasets represented in the ecoinvent database.; UUID: 1f6e11ec-c669-309f-b0d5-97f71b7cfc5a
This dataset covers raw material input and production efforts for the production of current capacitors.
Location: Data represent global valuable composition data for capacitors. For the 2023 capacitors, it is found that technological changes for power electronics since 80s have been maintained. However, the market share is adjusted according to the recent statistics in the literature (Group, 2020): film capacitors (50%), SMD/ceramic capacitors (30%), electrolytic (19%) with equal split for each type, and lastly tantalum capacitors (1%).
Technology: average production of: formulation; build-up process; cutting; bisquing; Pre-Firing; Firing; Tumbling; Termination (SMT) resp. metallization; slitting; winding; metal spray; heat treatment; sawing; lead welding; epoxy filling (THT)
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: see Geography and General Comments
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1f6e11ec-c669-309f-b0d5-97f71b7cfc5a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
